cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: VEPeagle
abstract: >-
  A browser-based visual evoked potential stimulus suite. Flash, pattern
  reversal, pattern onset, radial motion onset and oddball paradigms run from a
  folder on disk with no installation, server or network connection. Stimulus
  timing is verified by a photocell reading a synchronization patch on the
  display, the display is characterized photometrically from a measured
  calibration file, and the WebGL2 and Canvas 2D render paths are compared
  pixel by pixel before every session. Each condition is fully described by its
  URL, and oddball sequences are reproducible from a seed.
